# src/packages/lumicore/src/evasion

## Purpose
Native censorship/evasion algorithms that are actually reachable from the crate graph.

## Contents
- Direct files (24): `client_ip_obfuscator.rs`, `cloak_obfs.rs`, `desync.rs`, `detect.rs`, `ech_plugin.rs`, `ev_evasion.rs`, `fingerprint.rs`, `fragment.rs`, `http_tricks.rs`, `mod.rs`, `noise.rs`, `packet_header.rs` …

## Interfaces and dependencies
- Rust module membership is controlled by `mod.rs`/`lib.rs`; Cargo is compile authority.
- Host-facing changes must preserve the versioned FFI envelope and private Go ABI declaration checks.

## Invariants
- Do not advertise or promote dormant native surfaces without the Cargo/ABI/CGO verification gate.

